    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/3842c9ed52bbf13bdfebd3c449b60f91.avif?t=1754982629\" width=600 height=111 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/878202cbc8df101aaae617b0ad56b005.poster.avif?t=1754982629\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/878202cbc8df101aaae617b0ad56b005.webm?t=1754982629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/878202cbc8df101aaae617b0ad56b005.mp4?t=1754982629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a journey inspired by Slavic mythology and Croatian folklore in this 2.5D action-adventure game inspired by the likes of Inside, Neva, and Song of Iron.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Dark Queen we hope to remind you of stories you've heard as a kid that made you dream of being a hero. Step into a fantasy book, into the shoes of a medieval knight, returning home from grueling battles of the Crusade.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, there's no time to rest, your homeland was woven into darkness by an evil queen. Fight with monsters and epic bosses throughout diverse landscapes, from enchanted forests to desolate wastelands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of creatures lurk behind that next bush, what kind of monsters will you encounter? Not even the bloodshed of the Crusade has prepared you for this - you'll have to step up and improve your abilities if you plan to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/5b479b64af402a88236c4270cdb63366.avif?t=1754982629\" width=600 height=134 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/f905ec2a59b17595d9bbf1f0a46d9073.poster.avif?t=1754982629\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/f905ec2a59b17595d9bbf1f0a46d9073.webm?t=1754982629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/f905ec2a59b17595d9bbf1f0a46d9073.mp4?t=1754982629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/2c2f01243e29817c6d1be673af604a6d.avif?t=1754982629\" width=600 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/450add59b16df995007b61a2819d1a01.poster.avif?t=1754982629\" width=800 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/450add59b16df995007b61a2819d1a01.webm?t=1754982629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/450add59b16df995007b61a2819d1a01.mp4?t=1754982629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106050/extras/dd5ae687d0637fbfa2cce66e98cfde81.avif?t=1754982629\" width=600 height=134